 } on Object { return const []; }
``

Hmm — wait, actually there's a subtlety: pinnedSteringRecordIds gets RELEASED on new deliveries (release events). The valve messages should be the CURRENTLY-pinned ids (replay), not the historical. Compute from the branch: `pinnedRecordIdsOf(branch)` ∩ MessageRecords. Simpler and always truthful:

```dart
final branch = await session.getBranch();
final pinned = pinnedRecordIdsOf(branch);
final messages = [for (final r in branch) if (r is MessageRecord && pinned.contains(r.id)) r.message];
``

That covers prompt + newest steering automatically. 

And in the valve, match live messages by content (role + text) — since persisted copies differ by identity. For UserMessage compare joined text; skip other roles (pinned records are user messages in practice; assistant checkpoints are carried by the existing summaries mechanism).

