({Map<String, String> labels, bool consolidated}) consolidatedHideMeta(List<SessionRecord?> records) =>
 (labels: ..., consolidated: true);
``

Hmm — simpler helper: `Map<String, String> hideBatchLabels(Iterable<String> recordIds, {required SessionRecord? Function(String id) recordAt})` → per-member label map.

```dart
Map<String, String> hideBatchLabels(
 Iterable<String> recordIds, {
 required SessionRecord? Function(String id) recordAt,
}) {
 final ids = recordIds.toList();
 if (ids.isEmpty) return const {};
 final label = toolHistogramLabel([for (final id in ids) recordAt(id)]);
 if (label.isEmpty) return const {};
 return {for (final id in ids) id: label};
}
``

And each writer: 
```dart
await session.appendHiddenRange(
 recordIds: ids,
