);
``

Hmm — `recordAt(id)` helper: write a small closure `SessionRecord? recordById(String id) { final seq = view.seqs.seqOf(id); return seq == null ? null : view.seqs.recordAt(seq); }`.

For emergency_relief.dart: has `view.seqs` (line 296 shows the same pattern) ✓.

